<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of soccer matches played in the German first division on Saturday:</p>
<p>Borussia Dortmund 1 (Reinhardt 45th) Karlsruhe 1 (Dundee 25th). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 55,000</p>
<p>Hamburg 0 Bayer Leverkusen 2 (Kirsten 52nd, 82nd). 0-0. 26,383</p>
<p>VfB Stuttgart 3 (Elber 15th, Hagner 24th, Poschner 30th) Bochum 1 (Koezle 20th). 3-1. 40,000</p>
<p>Freiburg 0 Bayern Munich 0. 22,500</p>
<p>1860 Munich 1 (Heldt 26th) Arminia Bielefeld 3 (Molata 40th, Kuntz 55th, Reina 90th). 1-1. 25,500</p>
<p>Fortuna Duesseldorf 1 (Werner 32nd-penalty). Schalke 3 (Wilmots 5th, Dooley 43rd, Max 81st). 1-2. 23,000</p>
